{"suttaId":"an5.110","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-v","vriCode":"s0403m1.mul","paras":[804,808],"vripara":"110"},"segments":{"an5.110:0.3":"Araññasuttaṃ","an5.110:1.1":"“Pañcahi, bhikkhave, dhammehi samannāgato bhikkhu alaṃ araññavanapatthāni pantāni senāsanāni paṭisevituṃ.","an5.110:1.2":"Katamehi pañcahi?","an5.110:1.3":"Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu sīlavā hoti…pe… samādāya sikkhati sikkhāpadesu;","an5.110:1.4":"bahussuto hoti…pe… diṭṭhiyā suppaṭividdhā;","an5.110:1.5":"āraddhavīriyo viharati thāmavā daḷhaparakkamo anikkhittadhuro kusalesu dhammesu;","an5.110:1.6":"catunnaṃ jhānānaṃ ābhicetasikānaṃ diṭṭhadhammasukhavihārānaṃ nikāmalābhī hoti akicchalābhī akasiralābhī;","an5.110:1.7":"āsavānaṃ khayā anāsavaṃ cetovimuttiṃ paññāvimuttiṃ diṭṭheva dhamme sayaṃ abhiññā sacchikatvā upasampajja viharati.","an5.110:1.8":"Imehi kho, bhikkhave, pañcahi dhammehi samannāgato bhikkhu alaṃ araññavanapatthāni pantāni senāsanāni paṭisevitu”nti.","an5.110:1.9":"Dasamaṃ.","an5.110:1.10":"Phāsuvihāravaggo paṭhamo.","an5.110:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an5.110:2.1":"Sārajjaṃ saṅkito coro,","an5.110:2.2":"sukhumālaṃ phāsu pañcamaṃ;","an5.110:2.3":"Ānanda sīlāsekhā ca,","an5.110:2.4":"cātuddiso araññena cāti. (12) 2."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-v","bookName":"Pañcakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0403a.att","from":242,"to":245,"paras":[{"para":242,"vripara":"109-110","refs":["an5.110:1"],"lines":["Navame <b>cātuddiso</b>ti catūsu disāsu appaṭihatacāro.","Imasmimpi sutte khīṇāsavova kathito.","Dasame <b>ala</b>nti yutto.","Idhāpi khīṇāsavova kathito."],"lineRefs":[["an5.110:1"],["an5.110:1"],["an5.110:1"],["an5.110:1"]]},{"para":243,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.110:1"],"lines":["Phāsuvihāravaggo paṭhamo. (12) 2."],"lineRefs":[["an5.110:1"]]},{"para":244,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.110:1"],"lines":["Andhakavindavaggo 1."],"lineRefs":[["an5.110:1"]]},{"para":245,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.110:1"],"lines":["Kulūpakasuttavaṇṇanā 111."],"lineRefs":[["an5.110:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-v","bookName":"Pañcakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0403t.tik","from":235,"to":239,"paras":[{"para":235,"vripara":"106-110","refs":["an5.110:1"],"lines":["Chaṭṭhe <b>adhisīle</b>ti nimittatthe bhummaṃ, sīlanimittaṃ na upavadati na nindatīti attho.","Attani kamme ca anu anu pekkhati sīlenāti <b>attānupekkhī</b>.","Sattamādīni uttānatthāneva."],"lineRefs":[["an5.110:1"],["an5.110:1"],["an5.110:1"]]},{"para":236,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.110:1"],"lines":["Ānandasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an5.110:1"]]},{"para":237,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.110:1"],"lines":["Phāsuvihāravaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. (12) 2."],"lineRefs":[["an5.110:1"]]},{"para":238,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.110:1"],"lines":["Andhakavindavaggo 1-4."],"lineRefs":[["an5.110:1"]]},{"para":239,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.110:1"],"lines":["Kulūpakasuttādivaṇṇanā 111-114."],"lineRefs":[["an5.110:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
